# 必考词 Unit14
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-必考词
# 描述: 必考词Unit14核心高频词汇

{{liberty}}{/ˈlɪbərti/}}{n. 自由；自由权}}{{The constitution guarantees liberty and justice for all.}}

{{license}}{/ˈlaɪsns/}}{n. 许可证；执照}}{{You need a license to operate a business in this area.}}

{{likewise}}{/ˈlaɪkwaɪz/}}{adv. 同样地；也}}{{He is a talented musician, and likewise a skilled painter.}}

{{limit}}{/ˈlɪmɪt/}}{n. 限度；v. 限制}}{{There is a limit to what one person can accomplish alone.}}

{{link}}{/lɪŋk/}}{n. 联系；链接；v. 连接}}{{There is a clear link between smoking and lung cancer.}}

{{literary}}{/ˈlɪtərəri/}}{adj. 文学的}}{{She won a prestigious literary award for her novel.}}

{{locate}}{/ləʊˈkeɪt/}}{v. 定位；找到}}{{The team located the source of the problem quickly.}}

{{logical}}{/ˈlɒdʒɪkl/}}{adj. 逻辑的；合理的}}{{The argument is logical and well-structured.}}

{{loyal}}{/ˈlɔɪəl/}}{adj. 忠诚的；忠实的}}{{The dog has been a loyal companion for many years.}}

{{magnificent}}{/mæɡˈnɪfɪsnt/}}{adj. 壮丽的；宏伟的}}{{The palace was a magnificent example of Baroque architecture.}}

{{maintain}}{/meɪnˈteɪn/}}{v. 维持；保养；主张}}{{It is important to maintain a healthy lifestyle.}}

{{majority}}{/məˈdʒɒrəti/}}{n. 多数；大多数}}{{The majority of students passed the final exam.}}

{{manage}}{/ˈmænɪdʒ/}}{v. 管理；设法}}{{She manages a team of twenty employees.}}

{{manifest}}{/ˈmænɪfest/}}{v. 表明；adj. 明显的}}{{The symptoms of the disease manifest in different ways.}}

{{manipulate}}{/məˈnɪpjəleɪt/}}{v. 操纵；操作}}{{The data was manipulated to support a false conclusion.}}

{{manner}}{/ˈmænər/}}{n. 方式；举止}}{{He spoke in a polite and respectful manner.}}

{{manufacture}}{/ˌmænjuˈfæktʃər/}}{v./n. 制造；生产}}{{The company manufactures electronic components for cars.}}

{{margin}}{/ˈmɑːrdʒɪn/}}{n. 边缘；利润；余地}}{{The profit margin for the product is quite slim.}}

{{massive}}{/ˈmæsɪv/}}{adj. 巨大的；大规模的}}{{The earthquake caused massive destruction to the city.}}

{{mature}}{/məˈtʃʊər/}}{adj. 成熟的；v. 成熟}}{{He has become more mature and responsible over the years.}}

{{maximum}}{/ˈmæksɪməm/}}{n./adj. 最大值（的）}}{{The maximum capacity of the hall is 500 people.}}

{{means}}{/miːnz/}}{n. 方法；手段}}{{Education is the most effective means of reducing poverty.}}

{{measure}}{/ˈmeʒər/}}{v. 测量；n. 措施}}{{The government introduced new measures to combat pollution.}}

{{mechanism}}{/ˈmekənɪzəm/}}{n. 机制；机械装置}}{{The brain has a complex mechanism for processing information.}}

{{media}}{/ˈmiːdiə/}}{n. 媒体}}{{Social media has changed the way people communicate.}}

{{mental}}{/ˈmentl/}}{adj. 精神的；心理的}}{{Mental health is just as important as physical health.}}

{{merchant}}{/ˈmɜːrtʃənt/}}{n. 商人}}{{The merchant traveled across the country selling goods.}}

{{mercy}}{/ˈmɜːrsi/}}{n. 仁慈；怜悯}}{{The judge showed mercy to the first-time offender.}}

{{mere}}{/mɪər/}}{adj. 仅仅的；只不过的}}{{The project is a mere starting point for future research.}}

{{merit}}{/ˈmerɪt/}}{n. 优点；功绩；v. 值得}}{{The proposal has considerable merit and deserves attention.}}

{{migrate}}{/maɪˈɡreɪt/}}{v. 迁移；移居}}{{Many birds migrate south in the winter.}}

{{military}}{/ˈmɪlɪtəri/}}{adj. 军事的；n. 军队}}{{The country increased its military spending this year.}}

{{minister}}{/ˈmɪnɪstər/}}{n. 部长；牧师}}{{The prime minister addressed the nation on television.}}

{{minor}}{/ˈmaɪnər/}}{adj. 较小的；次要的}}{{The differences between the two proposals are minor.}}

{{minority}}{/maɪˈnɒrəti/}}{n. 少数；少数民族}}{{The rights of minorities must be protected by law.}}

{{miracle}}{/ˈmɪrəkl/}}{n. 奇迹}}{{The recovery of the patient was nothing short of a miracle.}}

{{mission}}{/ˈmɪʃn/}}{n. 使命；任务}}{{The astronauts completed their mission successfully.}}

{{mobile}}{/ˈməʊbaɪl/}}{adj. 移动的；n. 手机}}{{Mobile technology has revolutionized the way we work.}}

{{moderate}}{/ˈmɒdərət/}}{adj. 适度的；温和的}}{{Moderate exercise can improve cardiovascular health.}}

{{modify}}{/ˈmɒdɪfaɪ/}}{v. 修改；调整}}{{The plan was modified to meet the new requirements.}}
